M('Selection / generalizability','M16',selection+' '+opportunity,coverage+[(J+'residual_diagnostics_by_fta_bin.csv','observed and fitted pooled rates')])
M('Software / reproducibility','M17','Frozen analyses used Python 3.10.8, statsmodels 0.14.5, NumPy 2.2.6, SciPy 1.15.3, pandas 2.2.3 and pyarrow 21.0.0. The isolated environment and archived source, data, code, protocols and results support reproduction. Stage 4A only reads frozen summaries, formats evidence and renders matplotlib figures; it does not rerun fitting or bootstrap procedures. Manuscript freeze and build manifests link every displayed result to its source.',[(J+'primary_result.json','software'),('docs/manuscript/manuscript_freeze.json','allowed_operations; forbidden_operations')])
